bWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Nm8N8GU7pYg2rnV_GlwrzQ","review_id":"aEsfqW-0EqDds9uNTPMrtg","date":"2017-06-19T15:36:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9415667057037354,"text_excerpt":"I like this location. I had flying enchiladas, and two double margarita's which were happy hour priced. we also did chips with guac, queso, and salsa. Chips seemed like they were store bought as opposed to made there. My guy got pork and slaw taco's, which the chef accidentally read as something else taco wise. they were about to remake them, and he said / no worries, just bring what ya made. the waitress brought slaw on the side. it was all good. Everyone seems happy here, and why not? its a gorgeous location. congrats on this one guys."},{"business_id":"Nm8N8GU7pYg2rnV_GlwrzQ","review_id":"oizLPgO3WKIXbReI_i8bdw","date":"2015-06-09T16:48:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9372785687446594,"text_excerpt":"Another cheap eats place downtown and I'm not mad at it. When I want yummy cheap Mexican food I can't help but thing of Juan's. I can gorge on queso, salsa and guac until the cows come home. My favorite thing about Juan's is how they don't judge my ability to drown myself in chips and dip, but rather celebrate it. I don't care for their burritos as much as I used to since I have fallen completely in love with the quesadillas. Specifically the one with goat cheese, spinach and adobo sauce with cucumber sour cream on the side. Get in my belly! The drinks are on point as they are at the other various locations. Thank you Juan's for always having a location within a 5 mile radius of wherever ..."},{"business_id":"Nm8N8GU7pYg2rnV_GlwrzQ","review_id":"ND9TN5cjtYkEkbSfIs9s6g","date":"2020-09-16T21:10:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9322211146354675,"text_excerpt":"I highly recommend the self-proclaimed Juan's Flying burrito has a little bit of everything in it and feed two people it's a generous portion the margaritas are on point and the chips are fantastic they package things to go so that they're easy to handle use eat and then include all the sauces you could possibly ever want definitely a great takeout place and definitely great take in and sit down have a few drinks kind of place! I really want a T-shirt but I always spend my money on the food to date lol. Gotta try this place if you haven't yet!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Nm8N8GU7pYg2rnV_GlwrzQ","photo_id":"bvl6Yuk1DNc-IFrkqOifog","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/bvl6Yuk1DNc-IFrkqOifog.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9419635534286499},{"business_id":"Nm8N8GU7pYg2rnV_GlwrzQ","photo_id":"NYAlkrKQwdFlw3vo0VHTRA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NYAlkrKQwdFlw3vo0VHTRA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8363358974456787},{"business_id":"Nm8N8GU7pYg2rnV_GlwrzQ","photo_id":"VzmRiER3uIF0zT5_IdUdJA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VzmRiER3uIF0zT5_IdUdJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.81613689661026}]},"notebook_case":null}
